<title>TURKEY: Turk Jan-Sept budget deficit soars to 751 trln lir.</title>
<headline>Turk Jan-Sept budget deficit soars to 751 trln lir.</headline>
<dateline>ANKARA 1996-10-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Turkish Finance Minister Abdullatif Sener said on Friday the consolidated budget deficit stood at 751 trillion lira in the first nine months of the year, up from 158.3 trillion in the same 1995 period.</p>
<p>He said revenues stood at 1,822 trillion lira and expenditures at 2,573 trillion lira.</p>
<p>-- Istanbul newsroom +90-212-2750875.</p>
</text>
